class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,300</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p31_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Duke of Arcata</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Valls\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Valls\">Inhabitants of  Valls</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Valls\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Locations in Valls\">Locations in  Valls</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Valls (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9WYWxscz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Organizations in  Valls</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Valls</b> was a city in <a href=\"/wiki/Damara\" title=\"Damara\">Damara</a> and the capital of the Duchy of <a href=\"/wiki/Arcata\" title=\"Arcata\">Arcata</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL9_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL9-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Defense\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defense</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was situated in the dusty plains of central Arcata—in western Damara—along a tributary to the <a href=\"/wiki/Beaumaris_River\" title=\"Beaumaris River\">Beaumaris River</a> at the western end of the <a href=\"/wiki/King%27s_Road\" title=\"King's Road\">King's Road</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-map_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-map-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-BP-p7_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BP-p7-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given its location, Valls was a bustling center for trade out of western Damara.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p31_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Mercenary groups for hire were easy to find in the city, and equipment for <a href=\"/wiki/Adventurer\" title=\"Adventurer\">adventurers</a> and mercenary groups was readily available, even in bulk.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BP-p7_6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BP-p7-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defense\">Defense</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defense\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defense\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The town was surrounded by a wall with three gates and twelve towers.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BP-p5_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BP-p5-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was defended by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ducal Guard (Arcata) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHVjYWxfR3VhcmRfKEFyY2F0YSk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Ducal Guard</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL9_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL9-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the death of King <a href=\"/wiki/Virdin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Virdin\">Virdin</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_of_Goliad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Battle of Goliad\">Battle of Goliad</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">Year of the Prince, 1357 DR</a>, Valls was overrun by refugees moving south to escape the invaders of <a href=\"/wiki/Vaasa\" title=\"Vaasa\">Vaasa</a>. The inns were overflowing, resulting in many people sleeping in barns or outside the walls in camps, where they were vulnerable to attacks by bandits or wild <a href=\"/wiki/Wolves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wolves\">wolves</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Worg\" title=\"Worg\">worgs</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Tiger\" title=\"Tiger\">tigers</a>. There was little wealth left in the town and, in response, refugees begged on the streets and merchants increased their prices.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BP-p3_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BP-p3-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Shortly after, the town was visited by the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_Doctor_Trundles\" title=\"Circus of Doctor Trundles\">Circus of Doctor Trundles</a>. At a parade through the town, a <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">bulette</a> escaped and tore up the cages of the other circus monsters. After a tumult, where a few people were killed, all monsters except the bulette, were recaptured.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p55_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p55-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-BP-p5-6_10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BP-p5-6-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The next year, after hearing about the rejuvenation of the <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodstone_(barony)\" title=\"Bloodstone (barony)\">Barony of Bloodstone</a> and the wealth of <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodstone_Mines\" title=\"Bloodstone Mines\">Bloodstone Mines</a>, Arcta's Duke <a href=\"/wiki/William_the_Lazy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"William the Lazy\">William the Lazy</a> plotted to invade and seize the mines for himself. Valls was the staging point for his troops, who marched north along the <a href=\"/wiki/Old_King%27s_Road\" title=\"Old King's Road\">old King's Road</a> and thus sparked the <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodstone_Wars\" title=\"Bloodstone Wars\">Bloodstone Wars</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBW-p16_11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBW-p16-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Arcata would be humiliated in the subsequent battle, and Duke William was only permitted to continue ruling the city and his duchy at the whim of the Baron of Bloodstone, <a href=\"/wiki/Gareth_Dragonsbane\" title=\"Gareth Dragonsbane\">Gareth Dragonsbane</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL9_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL9-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> He was soon understood to be merely a figurehead.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p31_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>With the end of the Bloodstone Wars later that year, the whole town seemed to be holding its breath to see the outcome of the contest for the Damaran throne between Baron Gareth Dragonsbane of Bloodstone and Baron <a href=\"/wiki/Dimian_Ree\" title=\"Dimian Ree\">Dimian Ree</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Morov\" title=\"Morov\">Morov</a>. Inspired by Gareth's actions in the Bloodstone Wars—notably the famous \"<a href=\"/wiki/Gareth%27s_Gamble\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gareth's Gamble\">Gareth's Gamble</a>\"—the people of Valls became strong supporters of his bid for the kingship.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p31_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL9_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL9-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was said that the Ducal Guard in the city was more loyal to Gareth than to William.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p31_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The town had ten inns and a tavern. There was a large central plaza, and a fairground was located just outside the city walls to the southwest.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BP-p5_7-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BP-p5-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mykros\" title=\"Mykros\">Mykros</a>, captain of the Ducal Guard in the mid-to-late 15<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TBL-p51_12-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-p51-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Duke <a href=\"/wiki/William_Horgath\" title=\"William Horgath\">William Horgath</a> the 8<sup>th</sup>, the nominal ruler of the city and duchy during and following the Bloodstone Wars.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p31_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p31-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Adventures</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodstone_Pass_(adventure)\" title=\"Bloodstone Pass (adventure)\">Bloodstone Pass</a></i> • <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bloodstone_Wars\" title=\"The Bloodstone Wars\">The Bloodstone Wars</a></i></dd>\n<dd><b><small>Referenced only</small></b></dd>\n<dd><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Throne_of_Bloodstone\" title=\"The Throne of Bloodstone\">The Throne of Bloodstone</a></i></small></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Valls?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-la